# Whitelist mode: ignore everything, then allow only what the live site needs.
# Internal docs (pricing, personas, copy drafts) stay out of this public repo.
*

!.gitignore
!index.html
!privacy.html
!terms.html
!sol-missed-call-calculator.html
!blog/
!blog/*.html
!blog/*.webp
!features/
